WEBVTT

00:12:28.621 --> 00:12:34.704
could rely on yourself, if you could take
care of yourself, pretty extreme way.

00:12:34.996 --> 00:12:37.496
Yeah. Testing yourself. But but I got

00:12:37.496 --> 00:12:43.621
the sense that that ability to do that was
was also underneath everything else

00:12:43.621 --> 00:12:44.621
that you were doing.

00:12:45.037 --> 00:12:46.787
I think so, too. And, you know,

00:12:46.787 --> 00:12:51.537
I think I want to say to like I think
though we all need to do that.

00:12:52.162 --> 00:12:56.746
You know, obviously somebody like me who
had a father who was abusive and not,

00:12:56.912 --> 00:12:59.829
you know, not the father
that any one wants.

00:12:59.829 --> 00:13:04.037
And then and then a mother who died,
I was really an orphan.